:"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, 75 years. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids, September to October came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those years. In 2025, the middle of the grids got 193% of normal in April to May and just 27% in November to December. Grid 19349 had its driest year in 1963 at 56%.</p>"}
